Subject: [PATCH 2/3] =?UTF-8?q?P2:=20kicad=5Fcli=20=E2=80=94=20defer=20Loa?=
 =?UTF-8?q?dGlobalTables=20to=20just=20before=20dispatch=20(patch=200002)?=
